      A1["<b>8 coded-gait behaviors</b> Worm Spider Hexapod Quad Centipede Crab Kangaroo Blob<br/>trainer_type ppo &middot; threaded true<br/>batch_size 2048 &middot; buffer_size 20480 (10 batches per update)<br/>learning_rate 3e-4, schedule linear &middot; beta 0.005 &middot; epsilon 0.2 &middot; lambd 0.95 &middot; num_epoch 3<br/>network: normalize true, hidden_units 256, num_layers 2<br/>max_steps 3,200,000 &middot; time_horizon 1000 &middot; summary_freq 20,000 &middot; checkpoint_interval 250,000"]
      A2["<b>reward_signals</b><br/>extrinsic: gamma 0.995, strength 1.0<br/>gail: gamma 0.99, strength 0.05, demo_path Assets/Demonstrations/&lt;Name&gt;.demo<br/><b>behavioral_cloning</b>: strength 0.3, steps 400,000"]
      A3["<b>4 biped behaviors</b> Grandma Grandpa Matt Nick (YAML anchor *biped)<br/>same hyperparameters, but network 512 &times; 3 &mdash; the shape ML-Agents uses for its own Walker<br/><b>NO gail, NO behavioral_cloning</b> &mdash; extrinsic only<br/>max_steps 30,000,000: the launcher time box is the real stop,<br/>so these four never reach the progress thresholds the ladder keys off"]
