    subgraph B["Config/BrokenLoco01.yaml &mdash; 1-hour attended fine-tune, 2026-09-02"]
      direction TB
      B1["<b>init_path</b> results/all8h_20260826_2244/&lt;Name&gt;/checkpoint.pt<br/>continues from the 8-hour run; global step resets, so max_steps 300,000 counts fresh<br/>summary_freq 10,000 &middot; keep_checkpoints 8 &middot; checkpoint_interval 40,000"]
      B2["<b>Extrinsic only</b> &mdash; BC/GAIL would pull the policy back toward the coded gait,<br/>which is exactly the crawl being escaped"]
      B3["<b>No curriculum.</b> Every parameter pinned to what the Flat race actually asks:<br/>goal_distance_max 20 &middot; goal_angle_span 0 &middot; rough_amplitude 0 &middot; track_kind 0<br/>hazard_level 0 &middot; quirk_power .08 &middot; quirk_mass .12 &middot; quirk_friction .15<br/><i>An hour is not long enough to climb the ladder, and the ladder was<br/>training them for goals the race never sets.</i>"]
      B4["<b>Target:</b> Worm, Spider, Centipede, Crab &mdash; the four that do not reach<br/>the finish on the 20 m Flat race. Quad, Hexapod, Kangaroo and Blob are listed<br/>only because Builds/AllEnv contains them. <b>Ship a retrained brain ONLY if it<br/>beats the incumbent in an actual race.</b>"]
      B5["<b>Caveat, measured:</b> Reward_WormLoco was not told about the 0.005 s step<br/>until 2026-09-02, so every brain trained in that window &mdash; broken_loco01 included &mdash;<br/>learned against a distorted reward: episodes cut at 5 s of no progress instead of 20,<br/>and every per-step penalty landing 4&times; per simulated second."]
      B1 --- B2 --- B3
      B4 --- B5
    end

